  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-coding-plans",
      "text": "[中文](README.zh.md) | English\n\nUse **multiple coding-plan subscriptions** inside [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) via **native OAuth / coding-endpoint LLM adapters** — no CLIProxyAPI subprocess.\n\n> Community plugin; not affiliated with OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Moonshot, or DeepSeek. Upstream APIs are unofficial and may break or violate vendor ToS — use at your own risk."
    },
    {
      "section": "Status",
      "text": "| Provider | Status | Auth |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| ChatGPT / Codex | **Ready** | Settings → **Sign in with ChatGPT** (browser OAuth / device code) |\n| Kimi Code | **Ready** | Settings → **Sign in with Kimi** (device flow) or Advanced API key |\n| Volcengine Ark Coding/Agent Plan | **Ready** | Settings → pick plan + paste console API key |\n| Zhipu GLM / MiniMax / Bailian / Tencent | Stub | PRs welcome — [docs/provider-porting.md](docs/provider-porting.md) |\n| Gemini / Antigravity | Stub | PRs welcome |\n| Claude Max / Pro | **Deferred (last)** | Stub |\n| Copilot / Cursor | Later | — |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Codex caveats",
      "text": "- **Connected** only means credentials exist under `$DSH_HOME/coding-plans/codex-auth.json`.\n- **Free ChatGPT accounts usually cannot run Codex**; a paid plan is required for inference.\n- Quota UI needs reachability to `chatgpt.com`; a network timeout does not mean you are signed out."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-coding-plans"
    },
    {
      "section": "local checkout:",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add link:/absolute/path/to/dsh-coding-plans\ndsh web\n```\n\nor:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:pengzhou267-ai/dsh-coding-plans\n```\n\nSee [INSTALL.md](INSTALL.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "1. **Settings → Coding Plans**\n2. Codex: **Sign in with ChatGPT**; Kimi: **Sign in with Kimi**; Ark: pick Coding/Agent Plan and save API key\n3. Models → **`coding-plans-codex`** / **`coding-plans-kimi`** / **`coding-plans-ark`** (Agent: **`coding-plans-ark-agent`**)\n\n```sh\ndsh-coding-plans login codex\ndsh-coding-plans login kimi\ndsh-coding-plans login ark --api-key <key> --plan coding\ndsh-coding-plans login ark --api-key <key> --plan agent"
    },
    {
      "section": "Architecture",
      "text": "TypeScript ports of mature OAuth/protocol implementations (pi-ai openai-codex, CLIProxyAPI kimi/codex patterns, dsh-codex), registered with `ctx.llm.registerAdapter`. See [docs/design.md](docs/design.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "Apache-2.0"
    }
